<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Bounces Off Tech-Driven Lows as Dip Buyers Emerge&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据说 GTCR 正在考虑 50B 美元的全球支付收购</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gtcr-is-said-to-weigh-50b-global-payments-buyout-video</link><description>彭博社的孙梦琪与丹尼·伯格一起参加“彭博交易”。 GTCR 在一份文件中证实，它正在探索收购 Global Payments，这将是有史以来规模最大的杠杆收购之一。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gtcr-is-said-to-weigh-50b-global-payments-buyout-video'&gt;据说 GTCR 正在考虑 50B 美元的全球支付收购&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：GTCR Is Said to Weigh $50B Global Payments Buyout&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gtcr-is-said-to-weigh-50b-global-payments-buyout-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:06:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>埃及大开罗地区道路交通事故造成至少30人死亡</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/egypt-road-accident-kills-at-least-30-in-greater-cairo</link><description>一辆运载石油产品的卡车在大开罗地区起火，造成埃及多年来最严重的交通事故，造成至少 30 人死亡。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/egypt-road-accident-kills-at-least-30-in-greater-cairo'&gt;埃及大开罗地区道路交通事故造成至少30人死亡&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Egypt Road Accident Kills at Least 30 in Greater Cairo&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/egypt-road-accident-kills-at-least-30-in-greater-cairo</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:08:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于中东不断升级的袭击给近几个月该地区原油运输的复苏蒙上阴影，油价小幅走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>赛诺菲 410 亿美元的 Insmed 交易显示了专利悬崖的成本</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/sanofi-s-41b-insmed-deal-shows-cost-of-a-patent-cliff-video</link><description>彭博社的娜奥米·克雷斯奇 (Naomi Kresge) 与丹尼·伯格 (Dani Burger) 一起参与“彭博交易”。赛诺菲股价周三攀升至 2025 年 5 月以来的最高水平，继宣布计划收购美国制药商 Insmed 后昨日强劲上涨。交易完成后，赛诺菲获得了华尔街的一些评级升级。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/sanofi-s-41b-insmed-deal-shows-cost-of-a-patent-cliff-video'&gt;赛诺菲 410 亿美元的 Insmed 交易显示了专利悬崖的成本&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Sanofi’s $41B Insmed Deal Shows Cost of a Patent Cliff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/sanofi-s-41b-insmed-deal-shows-cost-of-a-patent-cliff-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:19:42 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>